REQUIREMENTS
------------

Any version of the OS.  An ANSI terminal.


COMMAND LINE USAGE
------------------

Usage: Ami-Othello <pri>

<pri> Task priority of the game.  When the computer player is thinking
      it  uses  a  lot of CPU resource, so it would be wise for you to
      set  the priority to a negative number, especially on multi-line
      systems.

example: Ami-Othello -1


